<title>JAPAN: Fuji Photo - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Fuji Photo - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		401.04		vs	  395.48</p>
<p> Operating	   57.15		vs	   46.79</p>
<p> Current	     58.96		vs	   56.17</p>
<p> Net		   31.84		vs	   29.76</p>
